234   c  ABST$Evaluated spectroscopic data and level schemes from radioactive   
234  2c  decay and nuclear reaction studies are presented for all nuclei with   
234  3c  mass number A=234. This evaluation for A=234 supersedes the earlier    
234  4c  one by E. Browne and J. K. Tuli (2007Br04), published in Nuclear Data  
234  5c  Sheets 108, 681 (2007).                                                
234   c  CUT$All data received by 1 December 2023 were evaluated.  The NSR      
234  2c  database (2014Pr09) was the main bibliographic source:                 
234  3c  www.nndc.bnl.gov/nsr                                                   
234   C  CIT$NDS 207, 351 (2026)                                                
234   c  ACKN$The evaluator wishes to thank E. A. McCutchan for help and        
234  2c  discussion throughout this evaluation. The help from the technical     
234  3c  staff of the National Nuclear Data Center (BNL) is highly acknowledged 
234  4c  for this evaluation process. The evaluator is grateful to the          
234  5c  compilers of the XUNDL database for their compilation of the relevant  
234  6c  datasets. Finally, the evaluator wishes to thank the reviewer for      
234  7c  their critical comments and suggestions.                               
