234TH2c  The reaction protons were studied with a broad-range spectrograph      
234TH3c  with 16-20 keV FWHM energy resolution. No excited 0{++} state was      
234TH4c  observed.                                                              
234TH c  1969Br11: A {+232}Th target (>90% purity) on a thin carbon backing     
234TH2c  was bombarded with an 18 MeV triton beam. The reaction protons were    
234TH3c  measured with |DE-E semiconductor detector at 60, 80, and 100          
234TH4c  degrees. Q(t,p)=2487 {I20} was obtained for the {+234}Th ground        
234TH5c  state. About 110 keV FWHM energy resolution.                           
