234U 4cG I|g(275|g)|?0.3, measured by 1968Bj06 in a coincidence experiment.     
234U 5cG The 275.04|g was placed by 1986Ar05 to deexcite only the level at      
234U 6cG 1447 keV. Its measured intensity of I|g(275|g)=0.09 {I2} suggests      
234U 7cG that this 275|g deexciting the 1447-keV level is probably weaker.      
