234U  c  2016Di11: Experimental Setup: Conversion electron spectroscopy using   
234U 2c  a dual-stage peltier-cooled 25 mm{+2} windowless silicon drift         
234U 3c  detector (SDD) and alpha spectroscopy with a passivated ion implanted  
234U 4c  planar silicon detector (PIPS) were used to measure {+238}Pu source    
234U 5c  with platinum backing. FWHM=12 keV at 5486 keV for PIPS. FWHM= 141 eV  
234U 6c  at 5.9 keV at 234K for the {+55}Fe x-rays. Source to detector          
234U 7c  distance was |?13 mm for PIPS and 5 mm for SDD. Measured: ce spectra,  
234U 8c  ce subshell ratio, X-ray energies, E|a.                                
