234U     232TH(A,2NG),232TH(9BE,A3NG)  1976WAZO,1985VE06         26NDS    202601
234U   H TYP=FUL$AUT=S. Ota$CIT=NDS 207, 351 (2026)$CUT=1-Dec-2023$             
234U  c  1985Ve06: {+232}Th(|a,2n|g): E(|a)=25 MeV; singles electron spectra    
234U 2c  were taken in 10-ns intervals with respect to beam bursts with a       
234U 3c  mini-orange spectrometer. |g-rays were measured with NaI.              
234U  c  1987Ze07: {+232}Th(|a,2n|g): E(|a)=28 MeV; (ce)(ce) and (ce)(|g)       
234U 2c  coincidences were measured with an orange spectrometer (iron-free      
234U 3c  spectrometer) and HPGe detectors, respectively. .                      
234U  c  1999La26: {+232}Th({+9}Be,|a3n|g): E({+9}Be)=52 MeV; measured E|g,     
234U 2c  I|g, |g|g(|q) with the CAESAR array of six Compton-suppressed HPGe     
234U 3c  detectors. Coincident |a were measured with an array of phoswich       
234U 4c  plastic scintillators.                                                 
234U  c  Others: 1982VaZS measured E|g, I|g, I(ce) from {+232}Th(|a,2n)         
234U 2c  reactions. 1976WaZO measured {+232}Th(|a,xn|g) reactions at 25-39      
234U 3c  MeV; E|g, I|g, deduced levels, K, J.                                   
234U  cG E$From 1987Ze07, 1985Ve06, 1982VaZS and 1976WaZO. Decays of levels in  
234U 2cG the |b-vibrational band were studied by 1985Ve06; decays of levels in  
234U 3cG the g.s. band were studied by 1976WaZO and by 1987Ze07; decay scheme   
234U 4cG of levels in the K=0- octupole-vibrational band were studied by        
234U 5cG 1987Ze07; |g's deexciting the levels in K=2+ |g-vibrational band and   
234U 6cG the 2+ level of the third K=0+ band are from 1982VaZS.                 
