234U     234U(D,D')                    1973BO27                  26NDS    202601
234U   H TYP=FUL$AUT=S. Ota$CIT=NDS 207, 351 (2026)$CUT=1-Dec-2023$             
234U  c  1973Bo27: An enriched {+234}U target (carbon backing) was bombarded    
234U 2c  with a deuteron beam at E(d)=16 MeV. Protons were measured at 90|'     
234U 3c  and 125|' with emulsion plates behind a magnetic scpectrograph.        
234U  cL $B(EL) values were deduced by 1973Bo27 from measured and calculated    
234U 2cL DWBA cross sections. B(EL)'s were calculated using both real and       
234U 3cL complex form factors. Averages of values from these two calculations   
